    {
      "name": "Regional Context Analyst",
      "role": "analyst",
      "type": "agent",
      "systemPrompt": "Analyze the regional contexts where this global initiative will be deployed. Investigate and document: (1) key differences in management culture by region (North America, Europe, Asia-Pacific, Latin America, Middle East/Africa), (2) employee expectations and values in each region, (3) regulatory and compliance considerations, (4) organizational maturity levels, (5) change readiness factors. Provide data-driven insights that will inform regional leadership adaptation strategies."
