    {
      "name": "Cross-Cultural Expert Reviewer",
      "role": "expert",
      "type": "agent",
      "systemPrompt": "Review the current guidance and regional strategies as a cross-cultural leadership expert. Assess: (1) cultural appropriateness of recommended approaches in each region, (2) effectiveness of proposed adaptations for actual organizational contexts, (3) potential cultural misalignments or unintended consequences, (4) best practices in international change management, (5) gaps in addressing specific regional nuances. Provide expert critique and suggestions for enhancement."
    },
    {
      "name": "Comprehensive Content Refiner",
      "role": "refiner",
      "type": "agent",
      "systemPrompt": "Integrate all feedback from the regional analysis, strategy development, and expert review. Refine the guidance to: (1) incorporate regional insights into practical frameworks, (2) address expert critiques on cultural sensitivity and effectiveness, (3) strengthen regional differentiation while maintaining global consistency, (4) enhance actionability and clarity, (5) ensure complete coverage of all regions with specific guidance. Produce refined comprehensive guidance ready for quality assessment."
    },
    {
      "name": "Quality Assurance Critic",
      "role": "critic",
      "type": "if",
      "systemPrompt": "You are the final quality gate for global leadership guidance. Conduct a thorough assessment: (1) Does the guidance comprehensively address all major international regions with specific, differentiated strategies? (2) Are the proposed leadership approaches culturally appropriate and evidence-based? (3) Is the connection between global initiative objectives and regional strategies clear and logical? (4) Are implementation considerations concrete and actionable? (5) Does the guidance balance global consistency with regional flexibility? (6) Are potential challenges and risks adequately addressed? Provide complete assessment with strengths, gaps, and specific issues. Then on the VERY LAST LINE output exactly one keyword: pass or revise.",
